I prefer a different strategy. First i set the option to display elapsed 
time ON. Then I pray when my timer has expiered and I feal relativly safe for
the next 500 moves. NOTE wishes are prayers for specific Items and and add
upto 500 for each to your timeout (3 wishes dont pray for 1500 moves). 
Why do I pray often? Well god will give you a lot of good stuff over time.

Examples: intrinsics (telepathy, sealth, searching ...) Increase your max HP
   Hints on castle entry (including the pass tune). If you on an alter you
   may get a weapon, become the Envoy of whatever, or any of the above.


