'you have a hopeful feeling' means your prayer timeout has NOT expired 
but has just been reducec. 'you see a four-leaf clover' means your 
timeout has expired and your luck was just increased. I have managed to max
my luck out before and you dont get a message (same as if value of monst to
low to have an effect).

:  BIG negative on that thought. It isn't like real religion where you are
: supposed to pray to keep your god happy. Praying in Nethack is for when
: you are in trouble and need your god to give you a hand. Your god will be
: angry if you pester him too often and will do something nasty to you. 
